></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em;\"><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.6em 0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, our original expression factors as follows:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"147\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-r